              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ni mugire umwete wo kurondeza Uhoraho Imana yanyu imitima yanyu yose n’ubugingo bganyu bgose. Muve hasi rero, mushireko mwubake urusengero rw’ Uhoraho Imana, kugira ngw isandugu y’isezerano ry’Uhoraho, n’ ibintu vyejejwe vy’Imana, muze mubizane, muvyinjize mur’ iyo ngoro izoba yubakiwe izina ry’ Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
